  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  headline: The Rogue Who Stole Afternoon Tea
  article: "Well known scoundrel, <b>Gorath</b>, made off with the whole town's lunch
    yesterday in yet another act of whimsical foolishness. \n\nWhen ahe town had
    gathered for their traditional afternoon feast, when their picnic basket of holding
    had been stolen. \n\nIn his hurried getaway however it appears that Gorath had
    attempted to hide himself inside the basket. Cutting it open  revealed countless
    squished sandwiches and the fool himself, gasping for air."
